column4:
a) To educate the women in the barangay (particularly the 4P’s and RIC) on the provisions of RA 9262(Anti-Violence Against Women and their Children) and RA 7877 (Anti-Sexual Harassment Act),                b)      To make them aware of the incidence of VAWC and help them how to address it in case they become victims or perpetrators of such violence;
c)      To minimize or avoid the perpetration of sexual harassment within the barangay particularly among the women (4P’s and RIC);
d)      To support the government in its thrusts in minimizing VAWC and SH in the barangays;
e)      To advance the GAD objectives in its quest of recognizing the role of women in nation-building.
